# LDraw files and test goldens must be stored byte-for-byte: Bricksmith writes CRLF line
# endings, and inputs may carry a UTF-8 BOM or legacy encodings. Never let git normalise them.
*.ldr   -text
*.mpd   -text
*.dat   -text
*.LDR   -text
*.MPD   -text
*.DAT   -text
trunk/Fixtures/golden/** binary
